### ========== 1. LOGIN → access + refresh ==========
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "Admin123!",
  "deviceId": "postman-1"
}

### ========== 2. Защищённый endpoint с Bearer access ==========
GET http://localhost:8080/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### ========== 3. REFRESH — новая пара ==========
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

### ========== 4. Повтор старого refresh → 401, сессия REVOKED ==========
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{oldRefreshToken}}"
}

### ========== REGISTER → 201 + пара ==========
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Новый Отправитель",
  "email": "newbie@example.com",
  "password": "Password1!"
}

### ========== REGISTER дубликат → 409 ==========
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Дубль",
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "Password1!"
}

### ========== LOGIN неверный пароль → 401 ==========
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "wrong"
}

### ========== SENDER login + список посылок ==========
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "sender@example.com",
  "password": "Sender123"
}

###
GET http://localhost:8080/api/shipments
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### ========== CSRF (если нужен для старых POST без JWT-ignore) ==========
GET http://localhost:8080/api/auth/csrf
